    "html_body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"></head>\n<body style=\"background:#0d1117;color:#c9d1d9;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;\n             padding:24px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;\">\n  <div style=\"background:#f85149;color:white;padding:10px 20px;margin-bottom:16px;\n              border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">\n    \u2691 URGENT COMMUNICATION \u2014 Requires Chairman Attention\n  </div>\n  <!-- TLDR BLOCK \u2014 always first thing the Chairman sees -->\n  <div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#161b22 0%,#1a2332 100%);\n              border:1px solid #f85149;border-radius:10px;\n              padding:20px 24px;margin-bottom:28px;\">\n\n    <!-- Agent + timestamp header -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\n                margin-bottom:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\">\n      <div>\n        <span style=\"background:#f85149;color:#0d1117;font-size:11px;\n                     font-weight:bold;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;\n                     text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;\">\n          CHIEF RISK OFFICER</span>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px;\">Open Risk Advisor \u00b7 Portfolio Risk Analytics</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:12px;text-align:right;\">\n        June 20, 2026  00:01<br>\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px;\">To: Jack Beard (Chairman)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Subject line -->\n    <p style=\"color:#e6edf3;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;\n              margin:0 0 16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #21262d;\n              padding-bottom:12px;\">\n      [IRM REVIEW] Apex Capital \u2014 R&D Team Briefing | Jun 20, 2026\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <!-- Context paragraph \u2014 what is this email and what does it mean? -->\n    <div style=\"background:#161b22;border-left:3px solid #21262d;\n                border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;padding:10px 14px;margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"color:#c9d1d9;font-size:13px;margin:0;line-height:1.6;\">\n        \u2139\ufe0f This is the <strong>Chief Risk Officer's independent risk report</strong>. It covers portfolio Value-at-Risk, historical stress scenarios, position concentration warnings, and a private performance evaluation of management. This report <strong>bypasses all other agents</strong> and goes directly to you \u2014 no agent has seen it.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Key metrics chips -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n          <div style=\"background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #58a6ff;\n                      border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;min-width:100px;\">\n            <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:10px;\n                        text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n              Confidence</div>\n            <div style=\"color:#58a6ff;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;\">\n              HIGH</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #3fb950;\n                      border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;min-width:100px;\">\n            <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:10px;\n                        text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n              Red Flags</div>\n            <div style=\"color:#3fb950;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;\">\n              3</div>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #58a6ff;\n                      border-radius:6px;padding:10px 14px;min-width:100px;\">\n            <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:10px;\n                        text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n              Omissions</div>\n            <div style=\"color:#58a6ff;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;\">\n              0</div>\n          </div></div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #21262d;padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:22px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color:#f0883e;margin:0;font-size:20px;\">\n      IRM SECOND OPINION \u2014 RD TEAM LEADER\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"color:#f85149;margin:4px 0 0 0;font-size:11px;font-style:italic;\">\n      \u2691 Chairman's Eyes Only \u2014 Independent Risk Manager review of the preceding email.\n      The sending agent is not aware this review exists.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"color:#8b949e;margin:6px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;\">\n      Reviewing: <em style=\"color:#c9d1d9;\">Apex Capital \u2014 R&D Team Briefing | Jun 20, 2026</em>\n      &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; June 20, 2026 at 00:01\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Confidence + Verdict -->\n  <div style=\"background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;\n              padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;gap:24px;\n              align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n        IRM Confidence in Report</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#3fb950;\">\n        HIGH</div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"flex:1;border-left:1px solid #30363d;padding-left:20px;\">\n      <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n        IRM Verdict</div>\n      <div style=\"color:#c9d1d9;font-size:14px;\">18 research picks reviewed. Risk environment: ELEVATED.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n  <!-- Findings -->\n  <h2 style=\"color:#e6edf3;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;\">IRM Findings</h2>\n  <div style=\"background:#161b22;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:8px;\n              padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;\"><li style=\"color:#c9d1d9;margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.6;\">R&D team generated 18 picks across 6 sector(s). 17 are high-conviction (4\u2605+).</li></ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Red Flags -->\n  <h2 style=\"color:#f85149;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\u2691 Red Flags</h2>\n  <div style=\"background:#1a1010;border:1px solid #f85149;border-radius:8px;\n              padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;\"><li style=\"color:#f85149;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.6;\">\u2691 FACTOR CONCENTRATION \u2014 Tech/Growth: 50% of R&D picks. Fama-French: factor tilts amplify both upside AND downside. In a rate-shock (2022 analogue), tech-heavy portfolios experienced -35% to -70% drawdowns. Recommend capping tech at 40.0%.</li><li style=\"color:#f85149;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.6;\">\u2691 DEPENDENCY VIOLATION: capital_efficiency_report is 3.8h old but manager_decisions is 6.0h old \u2014 manager_decisions ran BEFORE capital_efficiency_report and used a stale signal.</li><li style=\"color:#f85149;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.6;\">\u2691 DEPENDENCY VIOLATION: review_recommendations is 3.6h old but manager_decisions is 6.0h old \u2014 manager_decisions ran BEFORE review_recommendations and used a stale signal.</li></ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Omissions -->\n  <h2 style=\"color:#f0883e;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\u25cc Notable Omissions</h2>\n  <div style=\"background:#1a1510;border:1px solid #f0883e;border-radius:8px;\n              padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;\"><li style=\"color:#8b949e;\">Nothing notable omitted.</li></ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Commendations -->\n  <h2 style=\"color:#3fb950;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;\">\u2713 What Was Correct</h2>\n  <div style=\"background:#101a10;border:1px solid #3fb950;border-radius:8px;\n              padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;\"><li style=\"color:#3fb950;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.6;\">\u2713 17 high-conviction picks identified \u2014 quality signal generation.</li></ul>\n  </div>\n\n  \n  <!-- IRM Board Panel -->\n  <h2 style=\"color:#a371f7;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:10px;margin-top:24px;\">\n    \u25c8 IRM Board Consensus\n  </h2>\n  <div style=\"background:#110e1a;border:1px solid #a371f7;border-radius:8px;\n              padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:12px;\">\n      <div>\n        <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n          Board Risk Score</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#f0c000;\">6/10</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;border-left:1px solid #30363d;padding-left:20px;\">\n        <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">\n          Board Verdict</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#c9d1d9;font-size:13px;\">MODERATE RISK \u2014 IRM Board finds manageable concerns. Monitor closely.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:8px;\">\n      Specialists consulted (Chairman's eyes only): Dr. Elena Vasquez, Marcus Chen, Dr. Priya Sharma, James Osei\n    </div>\n    <ul style=\"margin:0;padding-left:18px;\"><li style=\"color:#c9d1d9;margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.6;\">No immediate quantitative interventions required. Continue monitoring VaR/CVaR on each pipeline run.</li><li style=\"color:#c9d1d9;margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.6;\">No significant behavioral biases detected this cycle. Continue monitoring decision patterns across runs.</li><li style=\"color:#c9d1d9;margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.6;\">Rebalance factor exposures. Introduce some Value or Quality names to offset momentum/growth concentration.</li><li style=\"color:#c9d1d9;margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.6;\">Ensure capital_efficiency_report runs before manager_decisions in the pipeline. See Step 2e (PDO) placement in main.py.</li></ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:11px;margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #21262d;\n            padding-top:12px;\">\n 